{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An AI-Training Puzzle RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlockWorld Ai</strong> is a puzzle RPG where you adventure with <i>Hoshihabito-kun</i> \u2014<br>an AI that watches how you solve puzzles, learns from your playstyle, and fights for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save your friends who have become aggressive, your puzzle-solving wisdom becomes the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI That Grows From Your Moves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI learns directly from the way <strong>you</strong> move and solve puzzles.<br>The techniques you use become the techniques the AI will use in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your AI, refine its playstyle, and watch it fight using strategies it learned from you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Number-Based Puzzle Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the numbers on each block to subtract and reach the <strong>target value</strong>.<br>Reduce it to zero to trigger a chain \u2014 match three blocks to unleash a combo.<br>Simple rules, deep strategy, fast-paced puzzle action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Battles With the AI You Raised</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trained AI stands before the boss and automatically battles using the knowledge it learned.<br>Support the AI with skills, manage SP, and guide it to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diagonal Clears Activate Powerful Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make diagonal matches through the center to activate your friends\u2019 skills.<br>Fill your SP gauge to unleash dramatic, visually striking special moves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Treasures to Strengthen Your AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather cubes to obtain <strong>Treasure items</strong> that upgrade abilities and unlock special effects.<br>Customize your AI\u2019s playstyle and gain an edge in boss battles.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Research","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/56fa1907184e7171efee41ad64828ef4fa1441f5.jpg"},{"name":"Friends with the Lab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/972931cbb16bce5a150cbb3e596698f54d080e8c.jpg"},{"name":"Block Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/050c9bd47f0bdab855a376383ec46779d155f90f.jpg"},{"name":"Block Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/92eed293f0516d91e251dbf2da6a3806105c3145.jpg"},{"name":"First Lesson","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/7cde73565207f2c1cd85006246a2fca6a9d175cb.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur Trainer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/22a78d7e400c1d23e8d30a3097d5c973bf8ceb85.jpg"},{"name":"Pro Trainer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/ad1e1e3378831b02fd343c467da09953fa3ef0de.jpg"},{"name":"Master Trainer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/4a933a6f1cff5da80997d6ade18d66de541a4227.jpg"},{"name":"Became Friends with a Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/4fcfaa2454371588508535526306838ff09762a4.jpg"},{"name":"Became Best Friends with a Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/ee099fe2ad449c30c00e083c1841c1e515ce9d3f.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3010030?t=1765303394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3010030?t=1765303394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010030/9ef420